                    <li><strong><a href="/automotive" class="highlight-link">Automotive:</a></strong> e-coated brackets, powder-coated structures, plated fasteners, anodized housings, and corrosion-protected hardware.</li>
                    <li><strong><a href="/data-center-power" class="highlight-link">Data center and electrical:</a></strong> anodized housings, conversion-coated aluminum, plated copper, conductive contacts, busbars, and corrosion-protected thermal hardware.</li>
